  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Drag this onto a melee weapon’s sheet.</strong> The weapon gains a permanent <em>Vengeful Blade</em> attack next to its normal one: a normal attack with that weapon that adds the cantrip’s extra necrotic damage and applies <em>Vengeful Aura</em> on a hit (until the start of your next turn; if the target attacks or casts a spell, it takes the detonation damage automatically and the aura ends).</p><p>Requires the caster to know <em>Vengeful Blade</em> (the patched version with the <em>Detonate</em> activity). Dropping it on the same weapon again reinstalls it.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
